                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.60 p 31/21: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Latvia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">White</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-08-18T13:00:00+01:36"><hi rendition="#italic">August 18,
                                1925—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received August 18—10:50
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>74. In view of my telegram number 73, August 12, 4 p.m., does Department’s
                    telegraphic instruction number 41, August 11, 3 p.m., still stand?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
